__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
node_modules/
dist/

# Large source documents are fetched by the importers, not committed.
simulators/*/sources/*.pdf

# Except the ones with nowhere to be fetched from. The CSM reports are published at a stable
# URL and the importer downloads them; the reform paper is not published anywhere, so if it
# is not in the repository it does not exist for anyone but its author — and a simulator
# whose central claim cannot be read by the reader is not an instrument for public debate.
!simulators/justitie/sources/reforma-sistem-judiciar-romania.pdf

# And the arondare decision. It has a stable URL, but sgg.gov.ro times out from GitHub's
# runners, so CI cannot fetch it — and a source CI cannot fetch is, for CI's purposes, a
# source that does not exist. 521 KB to keep the reproducibility gate working.
!simulators/justitie/sources/hg-1217-2023-arondare.pdf

# And the pension bill: mmuncii.gov.ro may be as unreachable from CI as sgg.gov.ro proved to
# be, and 235 KB is a cheap way not to find out during a deploy.
!simulators/justitie/sources/lege-pensii-magistrati-2025.pdf
simulators/*/sources/*.html

# Except the consolidated Fiscal Code, which legislatie.just.ro refuses to serve to GitHub
# Actions runners — four attempts in one run, each closed before a byte arrived, while the
# same request succeeds from a laptop. Same reason the pension law above is kept: 1,0 MB
# gzipped is a cheap way not to find out during a build. See import_cod_fiscal.py.
!simulators/impozit-teren/sources/cod-fiscal-consolidat.html.gz

# And the machine-readable sources the importers fetch: the INS matrix definition and the
# ECB reference rates. Both are re-fetched on every run, and the rates file changes daily,
# so committing it would put a diff in the repository every morning.
simulators/impozit-teren/sources/ins-*.json
simulators/impozit-teren/sources/ecb-*.xml

# The country-wide study cache: ~300 MB of PDFs and their extracted tables, all
# re-fetchable and re-derivable. Neither belongs in git.
simulators/impozit-teren/sources/studies/
simulators/impozit-teren/sources/unnpr-index.html
simulators/impozit-teren/cache/

# The Romanian language pack for tesseract, fetched by hand for ocr_cache.py.
# 2.3 MB of model weights that belong to the tesseract project, not to this repository.
simulators/impozit-teren/tessdata/
